<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/40/eng@/~cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 22A of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words \"under section\" the words \"10B,\". Amendment of section 135"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/40/eng@> .
