<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/40/eng@/~cl_5> <https://schema.org/name> "Section 135 of the principal Act is amended—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/40/eng@> .
