<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/40/eng@/~cl_7> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 142 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after paragraph (35B) the following paragraphs: \"(35c) to regulate the conduct of all matters relating to customs rulings; (35D) to prescribe and impose fees relating to customs rulings and provide the manner for collecting and disbursing such fees; (35E) to prescribe the forms to be used for the purpose of customs rulings;\". Amendment to section 143"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/40/eng@> .
