<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/40/eng@/~cl_8> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 143 the following section: \"Appeal from decision of Director General 143. Any person aggrieved by the decision of the Director General may, except in any matter relating to compound or subsection 128(3), within thirty days from the date of the notification in writing of the decision to him, appeal to the Tribunal, and the decision of the Tribunal shall be final.\". Deletion of section 143A"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/40/eng@> .
